<title>CHINA: HK'S OUTWARD PROCESSING TRADE TO CHINA IN Q1.</title>
<headline>HK'S OUTWARD PROCESSING TRADE TO CHINA IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department issued the following data on Tuesday on the estimated value of the territory's outward processing trade with China in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>(rounded figures in billions of Hong Kong dollars and year-on-year percentage change in brackets):</p>
<p>				   1st qtr 1997	4th qtr 1996</p>
<p> Total Exports to China     51.34 (+12.9)     56.52 (- 0.9)</p>
<p> Domestic Exports to China   8.81 (- 1.2)     11.80 (+ 6.2)</p>
<p> Re-exports to China	  42.53 (+16.3)     44.72 (+15.0)</p>
<p> Imports from China	   96.78 (- 1.4)    116.51 (+15.0)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
